Project Overview
This lab simulates a real SOC environment using:

A Windows 10 endpoint generating Security Logs, Sysmon telemetry, and PowerShell Operational logs

A Splunk Enterprise server ingesting logs via the Universal Forwarder

A full XML‑based parsing pipeline using Splunk_TA_Windows

Detection engineering including brute‑force correlation logic and Sysmon‑based behavioral analysis

The goal is to demonstrate practical SOC analyst and detection engineer skills through a fully functioning telemetry pipeline and real attack simulations.
